  'tour.hi.h': `Welcome to Japan Explorer`, 'tour.hi.b': `A one-minute tour of this map of Japan then and now: which ancient provinces became today's 47 prefectures? Tap any prefecture on the map to select it; pinch (or scroll) to zoom and drag to pan.`,
